        "code_excerpt": "// PRIMARY: beacon-chain/blockchain/kzg/kzg.go:ComputeCellsAndKZGProofs (lines 84-94)\nfunc ComputeCellsAndKZGProofs(blob *Blob) (CellsAndProofs, error) {\n\tvar ckzgBlob ckzg4844.Blob\n\tcopy(ckzgBlob[:], blob[:])\n\tckzgCells, ckzgProofs, err := ckzg4844.ComputeCellsAndKZGProofs(&ckzgBlob)\n\tif err != nil { return CellsAndProofs{}, err }\n\treturn makeCellsAndProofs(ckzgCells[:], ckzgProofs[:])\n}\n\n// CALLER: beacon-chain/core/peerdas/reconstruction.go:ConstructDataColumnSidecars (lines 150-153)\n\tcells, err := kzg.ComputeCells(&kzgBlob)\n\tif err != nil { return nil, errors.Wrap(err, \"compute cells\") }\n\n// RELATED: beacon-chain/core/peerdas/p2p_interface.go:VerifyDataColumnsSidecarKZGProofs (lines 61-93)\nfunc VerifyDataColumnsSidecarKZGProofs(sidecars []blocks.RODataColumn) error {\n\t// Batch verify that the cells match the corresponding commitments and proofs.\n\tverified, err := kzg.VerifyCellKZGProofBatch(commitments, indices, cells, proofs)\n\tif !verified { return ErrInvalidKZGProof }\n}"
      },
