    "summary": "No `ommers_hash` symbol exists in the beacon block body or execution payload types processed by Prysm's P2P layer. The check `ommers_hash == EMPTY_OMMER_HASH` is not implemented in Prysm, nor is it required — the EL handles this check internally during block execution. The P2P validation path does not contain an exploitable ommers bypass.",
