    "summary": "The P2P validation path (gossip validation -> block processing -> notifyNewPayload -> engine_newPayloadVX) correctly delegates ommers validation to the EL. There is no attacker-accessible path that bypasses EL validation for ommers, since the EL processes the raw execution block and independently enforces the ommers constraint.",
